      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like \"grief\" though. it feels like being empty. like there's nothing left in me to even process it. i just look at my life and all i see is a giant hole where my years used to be. i honestly just want to sleep. i want to go to sleep and just not have to deal with any of this ever again. i just want it to stop.",
